<title>JAPAN: Cosmo Oil restarts Sakai topper.</title>
<headline>Cosmo Oil restarts Sakai topper.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Refiner Cosmo Oil Co Ltd said it put a 110,000 barrel-per-day crude distillation unit at its Sakai refinery in central Japan back on line on Tuesday afternoon.</p>
<p>The topper had been closed since a fire broke out near the unit on October 24.</p>
<p>The facility is expected to be operating at full capacity by 3 p.m. (0600 GMT) on Wednesday, a Cosmo Oil spokesman said.</p>
</text>
